      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/falconaire_texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Falconaire features a low-relief environment with thorny shrubs, mesquite trees, cacti, and scattered live and post oaks.",
